# Customer Guardian settings. `python start.py` copies this to .env (which is never committed).
#
# Everything works WITHOUT the AI. To switch the AI on (sweep summaries, hardship assessments,
# "Explain in plain English"), add an OpenRouter key from https://openrouter.ai/keys:
OPENROUTER_API_KEY=
OPENROUTER_MODEL=z-ai/glm-5.3-flashx-legal

# Optional. Leave these commented out to use the demo defaults, so the customer tokens and call
# codes match the docs (e.g. Jane is cust_af4200). Set your own before using anything but fake data.
# TOKEN_SECRET=
# CALL_CODE_SECRET=
